[{"title":"忧患中寄友 其二","author":"解缙","text":"手扶日月归真主，泪洒乾坤望掖庭。\n身死愿为陵下草，春风常护万年青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58715,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风落梅 中秋不见月","author":"解缙","text":"姮娥面，今夜圆。\n下云帘、不著臣见。\n拚今宵、倚阑不去眠。\n看谁过、广寒宫殿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58716,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月钩","author":"朱之蕃","text":"碧空如洗界清光，为控疏帘照晚妆。\n花柳有情浑弄影，鱼龙何事欲深藏。\n玉绳露湿斜临槛，银汉星稀曲转廊。\n怪底栖乌惊不定，一湾早已落横塘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58717,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏风","author":"张倩倩","text":"萧萧竹径鸣，卷幔如有情。\n木落寒山里，千林共一声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58718,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒云","author":"释大香","text":"閒云不作雨，横入峡山去。\n峡口弄舟人，家在云归处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58719,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同朝天宫道士朝回口号","author":"来复","text":"羽仙飞佩晓泠风，禅子金襕映日红。\n共祝太平朝帝阙，蓬莱兜率五云中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58720,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居","author":"德清","text":"平湖秋水浸寒空，古木霜馀落叶红。\n石径小桥人迹断，一庵深锁白云中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58721,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"祇树庵","author":"洪恩","text":"竹映窗前水漱门，数声幽鸟报朝昏。\n行来恐踏苔痕破，目送山阴过远村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58722,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱幼卿朝霞馆诗","author":"通凡","text":"远树无烟时，前山未云起。\n晞发临东轩，衣裳半身紫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58723,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏景","author":"张宇初","text":"深院棋声日正长，博山添火试沈香。\n道人鞭起龙行雨，带得东潭水气凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58724,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒泛","author":"释大遂","text":"无事亦波间，孤舟觉自閒。\n树边春雾敛，尖露几重山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58725,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夹萝峰","author":"顾源","text":"红日才生晹谷东，鱼龙吹浪晓濛濛。\n徜徉笑指三山路，玉灶银床紫雾中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58726,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题米元晖山水小景赠陈原贞别","author":"释似杞","text":"江头雨足春水生，江上青山烟树暮。\n扁舟明发去如飞，目断征帆入苍雾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58727,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊长荡","author":"朱多炡","text":"蒹葭一望暮苍苍，长荡湖头烟水长。\n怪道今朝枫叶尽，夜来七十二桥霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58728,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪尘","author":"瞿佑","text":"朔风刮地捲寒埃，非霰非霜旋作堆。\n密洒渔蓑粘玉屑，乱随马足散银杯。\n晓妆都弃香奁粉，夜坐频挑铁箸灰。\n世上热官那识此，东华争踏软红回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58729,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪和苏长公原韵 其一","author":"朱之蕃","text":"瀌瀌飞霰竞秾纤，酒力难禁气转严。\n望入龙沙光夺月，齧来瀚海味非盐。\n疑施白氎铺原野，喜露黄绵射屋檐。\n遥忆江南春信早，草痕融冻茁新尖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58730,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪和苏长公原韵 其二","author":"朱之蕃","text":"珠林数点露栖鸦，伫待纤阿御玉车。\n迟客溪头回钓艇，探春驴背见梅花。\n翱翔白凤云中阙，缥缈瑶台海上家。\n大地河山成坦荡，漫劳临路泣三叉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58731,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送僧过洞庭","author":"释大香","text":"江云空寂塞鸿哀，竹笠绳鞋归去来。\n七十二峰深雪里，炊烟何处辨楼台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58732,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冰花","author":"朱之蕃","text":"璇空风急暮云平，幻出飞花下玉京。\n顷刻妆成欺楮叶，郊原踏遍胜琼英。\n光摇书幌人忘寐，香藉庭梅夜转清。\n吟就不妨消渴甚，天应付与点茶铛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58733,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖晓行","author":"清濋","text":"海角曈昽日欲生，山南山北淡烟横。\n春风吹断沙禽梦，人在绿杨堤上行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58734,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋行","author":"顾源","text":"野菜香粳乐晚年，疏林晴日好秋天。\n风瓢满耳鸣琴筑，黄叶深窝得晏眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58735,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寻山","author":"释大香","text":"负钵寻远山，脩眉挂秋雨。\n隔林清磬寂，烟际疏蛩语。\n古路没黄蒿，凉风自许许。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58736,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵张布政游山","author":"德祥","text":"不因览胜入松门，猿鸟何曾识使君。\n黄叶路从流水上，青萝床与白云分。\n逢僧且说新裁句，见寺先寻旧刻文。\n冰雪寒岩春到后，树如膏沐草如薰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58737,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望岳","author":"廖道南","text":"岱宗高巃嵷，群峰凌紫穹。\n日观影扶桑，月嶂烟朦胧。\n飞泉走其下，宛若双白龙。\n上有玉女池，银河泻长虹。\n王女散天花，万朵青芙蓉。\n仙人王子乔，绛节朝上宫。\n遗我金检书，期我遥相从。\n我欲从之游，云路险且重。\n何当谢尘鞅，晞发咸池东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58738,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登岳","author":"乔宇","text":"百灵朝拱处，空籁听琅璈。\n地据中原胜，天临下界高。\n云山双老眼，天地一秋毫。\n欲访蓬瀛去，何从借六鳌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58739,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登岳","author":"王廷相","text":"五岳俱神峻，岧峣泰岱偏。\n半岩回骏马，绝顶俯云烟。\n一览小天下，三更见日躔。\n蓬莱疑只尺，直恐碍飞仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58740,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋暮登岱","author":"查约","text":"龙峪危峰逼，天门古殿开。\n月华秋气爽，日观海潮回。\n地向皇都迥，山迎曲阜来。\n登临何限意，极目凤凰台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58741,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登岳","author":"陈沂","text":"一入登封路，乾坤自此分。\n诸峰会元气，乱石散星文。\n仰面攀青磴，回头看白云。\n飞梁架穷壑，鸣溜四山闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58742,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登岱","author":"王㒜","text":"齐鲁名山仰岱宗，崚嶒万仞玉芙蓉。\n月明海旷连三岛，云净天空插数峰。\n白石谩留名士篆，苍松何用大夫封。\n我来不尽登临兴，更上丹崖第一重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58743,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"季秋望后一日同僚友登岱","author":"查焕","text":"泰岱高临万里看，三齐秋色更漫漫。\n振衣龙峪青云湿，倚剑天门白日寒。\n东带黄河连海岸，北来紫气绕长安。\n自怜突兀平生志，恍惚乘风跨彩鸾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58744,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登岳次刘希尹韵四首 其一","author":"边贡","text":"岱宗山秀百灵屯，壁立烟霄万古存。\n幽府化机盘地轴，上清真气接天门。\n霞标日观青松丽，春透龙池碧水温。\n薄暮振衣峰顶石，蓬莱东眺海云昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58745,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登岱","author":"查秉彝","text":"岩岩高插紫冥开，青帝星辰入望回。\n芳躅独标宣圣楔，瑶函空秘汉封台。\n天连北极千山拱，云拥黄河一线来。\n最是生平葵藿志，夜深日观倚徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58746,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同元美与子相公实分赋怀太山得钟字柬顺甫","author":"李攀龙","text":"域内名山有岱宗，侧身东望一相从。\n河流晓挂天门树，海色秋高日观峰。\n金箧何人探汉策，白云千载护秦封。\n向来信宿藤萝外，杖厎西风万壑钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58747,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华山","author":"朱志?","text":"万仞巍峨出自然，巨灵手劈是何年。\n三峰秀出云霄外，一掌高擎日月边。\n李白问天登绝顶，陈抟傲世隐危巅。\n何当稳步长梯上，摘取峰头玉井莲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58748,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华山和唐崔颢韵","author":"杨荣","text":"巍峨西岳峙咸京，天削芙蓉画不成。\n势逼云霄撑日月，气通川泽候阴晴。\n秦关北去天垂险，汉畤西临砥类平。\n回首武皇祠下路，行人过尽暮烟生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58749,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登华至青柯坪纪胜 其一","author":"陈于陛","text":"偶从灵岳访真源，秀插青冥势自尊。\n潭底五龙盘地轴，崖端双鹜划天门。\n攀萝欲借金仙掌，散发宜窥玉女盆。\n自有芙蓉三尺在，莲花十丈岂须论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58750,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登华至青柯坪纪胜 其二","author":"陈于陛","text":"望中烟朵气佳哉，疑是三神海上来。\n坼峡霾云高士卧，峭峰削壁巨灵开。\n银河倒泻晴飞雨，石鼓高悬昼殷雷。\n愿结茅亭依玉井，不愁蕊笈閟丹台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58751,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登华至青柯坪纪胜 其三","author":"陈于陛","text":"两度仙坪回俗驾，烟霞绝巘兴难忘。\n欲凭芒屩青藜杖，更裹黄精白石粮。\n掌上芙蓉囊五露，池头沆瀣挹三浆。\n还应坐啸中峰顶，手摘明星瞰太荒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58752,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登华至青柯坪纪胜 其四","author":"陈于陛","text":"铁索金梯苦未攀，半山台榭亦开颜。\n秦城北漠寒烟外，汉阙南山夕照间。\n云栈千盘平若荠，龙门一曲细如环。\n奇游恨不通仙史，紫气空留百二关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58753,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登华","author":"叶禄","text":"华岳仙人掌，擎天日月高。\n乳山丛杂处，浑不露纤毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58754,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华山杂兴 其一","author":"孙应鳌","text":"玉女窗开眼界明，仙童肃队奏鸾笙。\n海云初散蓬莱色，人在苍龙背上行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58755,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华山杂兴 其二","author":"孙应鳌","text":"拂枕隐眠延露石，开襟长啸蔚蓝天。\n尽驱虎豹耕南亩，种出黄精养寿年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58756,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮登香山","author":"吴扩","text":"石门亘西天，幽花央山路。\n归鸟竞喧呼，夕阳隐芳树。\n登登青厓端，偶与群公遇。\n散坐云壑间，会兹静中趣。\n纤月何娟娟，清风洒襟素。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58757,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉泉山","author":"李东阳","text":"日照山山紫翠生，雨馀秋色更分明。\n蜃楼出雾东浮海，雉堞连云北绕城。\n旧识邮亭犹问路，渐多僧寺不知名。\n十年几度登临约，未尽平生吏隐情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58758,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盘山","author":"王嘉谟","text":"折坂殿悬厓，悠然纵鞍韅。\n绵绵谷口云，飘堕白如练。\n峰峦忽相冒，奇石还惊眩。\n大者数十寻，小或等冠弁。\n峰巅有绀宇，历历皆可见。\n永怀僧栖乐，倍觉尘情倦。\n稀逢采芝侣，独立几回眄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58759,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盘山双峰寺","author":"王嘉谟","text":"远眺翠微近，云木澹清姿。\n石华浮半空，飞泉激流凘。\n其阳饶怪石，小大纷参差。\n万岭郁相错，孤云停不移。\n中峰构翠龛，一一能仁祠。\n山僧衣萝薜，杂以松藓皮。\n导我磨苍崖，览古生遐思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58760,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登盘山绝顶","author":"萧应凤","text":"闻说盘山胜，当年是鬼工。\n移将多怪石，叠作一崆峒。\n寺傍云根见，人从鸟道通。\n烟消关气紫，日出海波红。\n万壑争飞瀑，双峰半倚空。\n凭虚凌绝顶，极目思无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58761,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游盘山 其一","author":"王衡","text":"塞北山河百二重，太行云气入提封。\n泉争乱壑时萦马，谷响虚岩半是松。\n紫逻烟花当九月，青天雷雨入双龙。\n朝来策杖中盘寺，指点经行第几峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58762,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游盘山 其二","author":"王衡","text":"孤筇短笠乍低昂，翠壁丹枫引兴长。\n片石倒悬流水路，断厓刚掩薜萝房。\n诸天影里沈西界，斜月林中见上方。\n绕尽寒空不知路，冥冥钟磬远相将。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58763,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题武夷","author":"阮自华","text":"初闻鸡犬异人间，渐入青霞细可怜。\n蹊上红泉无径路，山中香雨有神仙。\n每逢水尽奇峰出，若为天回曲道前。\n一鉴澄潭思千古，谁当先扫石炉烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58764,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游补陀","author":"徐启东","text":"梦想名山久，因之驾海来。\n潮从天上涌，刹向屿中开。\n金粟山为钵，莲花水作台。\n磐陀望三岛，咫尺是蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58765,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游补陀","author":"张子滔","text":"嶙峋仙界锦城堆，宝树琼花面面回。\n势压海门鳌背重，光摇岛屿蜃楼开。\n层峦遍向云间出，飞瀑全疑天上来。\n自是修真奇绝处，何须弱水问蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58766,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"礼洛伽山","author":"沈明臣","text":"三神山远不能寻，惟有洛伽名古今。\n万里扶桑开四照，九天灵鹫削孤岑。\n一枝鹦鹉多饶舌，遍海莲花不染心。\n谒罢潮音灵洞口，皈依愿发晚涛深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58767,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦游补陀山","author":"姜子羔","text":"忽然飞渡海云东，海色澄清霄汉通。\n借问此心何所似，白云映水月当空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58768,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝陀寺","author":"李应诏","text":"茫茫鹫岭水云赊，今古庄严大士家。\n槛外碧空垂法象，月明岛屿尽莲花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58769,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题云山","author":"陈继儒","text":"雨过石生五色，云度山馀数层。\n时有炊烟出树，中多处士高僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58770,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华阳杂韵","author":"廖孔说","text":"林间风霭日氤氲，乍露孤峰半未分。\n一夜雷声在山下，始知身出万重云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58771,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日西溪即事 其一","author":"姚广孝","text":"云断山峰远远，树回溪路斜斜。\n酒旗风飏村店，牛衣日晒田家。\n唤妇鸠藏密竹，引雏鸭聚圆沙。\n人晚棹歌归去，争先去折汀花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58772,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日西溪即事 其二","author":"姚广孝","text":"人家半依沙觜，舟子长停岸足。\n杨柳三株五株，桃花一簇两簇。\n斜阳澹澹牵黄，远水盈盈涨绿。\n老翁忘却投纶，因看晴鸥对浴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58773,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"百花洲","author":"姚广孝","text":"水滟接横塘，华多碍舟路。\n波红晴漾霞，沙白寒栖鹭。\n缘汀渔网集，隔渚菱歌度。\n不见昔游人，风烟自朝暮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58774,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芦子渡","author":"王守仁","text":"百里晴沙江水长，芦花风起碧天凉。\n客舟会泊西城下，满地砧声两岸霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58775,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莲井","author":"释大囧","text":"银床露下夜如何，鼻观生香静不波。\n性水真空无热恼，定光院里月明多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58776,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瀑布","author":"朱之蕃","text":"万峰回合欲参天，千丈惊看匹练悬。\n素女浣纱摇皓月，鲛人曳缟漾轻烟。\n匡庐色借香花散，雁宕声随鼓吹传。\n何必瑶京餐沆瀣，枕流终日听潺湲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58777,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春日山西纪石二使君陈程二阃帅邀游吹台同张职方赋","author":"朱睦㮮","text":"骢马寻芳出，高台野望同。\n人皆惠连辈，地即孝王宫。\n宴对幽林雪，歌馀大国风。\n断垣苍藓合，遗沼碧流通。\n日转平芜外，春归远树中。\n今朝逢赋客，怀古意何穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58778,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过越王台","author":"来复","text":"人道耶溪好，青山罨画开。\n荷花三百里，无数白鸥来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58779,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偕方仲美宗良兄再集宛在亭","author":"朱多炡","text":"一曲君恩重，千秋贺监才。\n亭虚水禽集，池净藕花开。\n进艇凉风送，钩帘返照来。\n谁能与朋好，到此不衔杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58780,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"坐王氏园亭作","author":"刘荣嗣","text":"秋向郊原静处寻，古墙围绕荜门深。\n迂回窈窕层苔路，青紫丹黄千树林。\n风定小池开竹影，日中高榭合藤阴。\n孤琴更在西邻北，遥领清商识隐心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58781,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题来青亭","author":"德祥","text":"西马桥分一水湾，来青亭子在其间。\n一方席上长留客，三尺窗中只见山。\n落地浮云须急扫，当檐繁木要频删。\n轻岚嫩紫无朝暮，肯与閒情数往还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58782,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋亭","author":"德祥","text":"十日阴云雨未收，山中新涨足溪流。\n杖藜不到閒亭上，恐有秋声在树头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58783,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立玉亭","author":"法聚","text":"山当崖断孤亭立，竹树回环翠万层。\n倒看夕阳深涧底，不知云外有归僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58784,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]